hase-mini  staff   96 Oct  3 16:54 _examples\ndrwxr-xr-x@  2 chase-mini  staff   64 Oct  3 17:05 robo-clash-arena\n\ngames/robo-clash-arena/:\ntotal 40\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 8 chase-mini  staff   256 Oct  3 17:09 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 4 chase-mini  staff   128 Oct  3 17:05 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 chase-mini  staff  8006 Oct  3 17:11 design.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 6 chase-mini  staff   192 Oct  3 17:11 logs\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 chase-mini  staff  3406 Oct  3 17:08 mechanics-notes.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 3 chase-mini  staff    96 Oct  3 17:09 prompts\n-rwxr-xr-x@ 1 chase-mini  staff   591 Oct  3 17:09 run_bg.sh\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 chase-mini  staff   544 Oct  3 17:11 status.md\ndd7928c robo-clash-arena: place/universe IDs\nee95412 robo-clash-arena: video analysis mechanics\n28c1ae8 robo-clash-arena: mechanics notes, design updates\n153d022 robo-clash-arena: design and status\n715c1f3 Seed RobloxDev workspace: agent skills, AGENTS.md, games/ and assets/ scaffolding\n","localExecutionTimeMs":68},"isBackground":false},"description":"List skills, game folder, git log"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"toolu_01U3HcqyDjTaGrgHnhpEqsRk","startedAtMs":"1791072684050","completedAtMs":"1791072684467"},"model_call_id":"f6f75537-51d9-46fb-a6c9-81f06ac674d8-0-0cvv","session_id":"cdeac534-366f-4359-ab90-975d2829fcb2","timestamp_ms":1791072684479}
